        <mxCell id="300" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Key Flows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Auth:&lt;/b&gt; Login → JWT issued → Workspace select → project-scoped JWT&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Edit:&lt;/b&gt; JWT header → OWL Editor → SPARQL update → Fuseki triplestore&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Collab:&lt;/b&gt; WebSocket STOMP (SockJS) → OWL Editor → broadcast to all members&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Billing&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;b style=&quot;color:#6a1b9a&quot;&gt;numbered on diagram&lt;/b&gt;): ① Client &lt;b&gt;POST /api/billing/checkout&lt;/b&gt; → ② Gateway routes to Auth → ③ Auth creates Stripe Checkout Session → ④ Stripe webhook returns subscription event → ⑤ Auth writes plan to MongoDB&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Invite:&lt;/b&gt; Auth sends SMTP → token link → accept → auto-add to projects by visibility&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. Merge:&lt;/b&gt; Upload OWL → OntologyMergeController → conflict detect → Fuseki write&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#666&quot;&gt;See &lt;b&gt;Page 5 (Auth &amp;amp; Billing Flow)&lt;/b&gt; for the per-step sequence diagram.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="493" x="55" y="822" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
